OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry to start, before a band of
OL,6,Frain spreads southeastwards through
OL,7,Fthe day. It will remain blustery
OL,8,Finitially, especially for exposed
OL,9,Fcoasts, with winds easing later as
OL,10,Fskies clear. Unseasonably mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain lingering in the west,
OL,13,Fbefore clearing into the early hours
OL,14,Fleaving clear spells behind with winds
OL,15,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
