OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA chilly start to Friday,
OL,6,Fleading to drier and brighter day with
OL,7,Fplenty of sunny spells, although with
OL,8,Fa risk of showers throughout. Feeling
OL,9,Fnoticeably cooler in the northwesterly
OL,10,Fbreeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA more
OL,13,Fsettled weekend to come with plenty of
OL,14,Fsunshine around all the way through
OL,15,Finto Monday. Although chillier nights
OL,16,Fbring a risk of frost and patchy fog.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
